cessing the healers shop from the Wilderness menu would cause a BusError, (bad procs number) this is fixed now.7/6/96  6:20am	-Bug Fix-AI Routines wern't.  I fixed the bugs introduced when porting the AI routines from Herrick and I's program to Slycrel.  Many many little bugs were fixed here.  Routines should now work, not sure if there are still minor bugs/memory leaks, but the Routines WORK now.7/6/96  5:00am	-Alteration-Ported Slycrel over to Metrowerks Codewarrior Pascal.  This introduced a minor bug with Slycrel checking for ANSI emulation before the game starts. I've put a temp patch on it, REMEMBER TO FIX PATCH!7/5/96  6:48pm	-New Feature-Implemented AI routines written at Herrick Muhlestein's house with his help.  AI routines are a variation of Edsger Wybe Dijkstra's 'shortest path' algorithm.  Need to alter so that monsters will run or taunt.  (change monsters destination)  (WAHOO!)6/28/96	3:10am	-Release-Released 'Slycrel dev v2.01'  Uploaded to Olympus BBS and the Twilight Zone BBS.6/28/96	2:41am	-Bug Fix-In the High Scores list there would occasionally pop up a nameless character who would have around 400 or so score.  This would occure whenever a user hit 'v' to view the high scores list from the 'intro' menu when slycrel is first started up.  I altered the High Scores code so that it no longer will insert a junk character, a little messy of a fix but it does work.6/28/96	2:11am	-Bug Fix-BBS would occasionally 'lockup' when a player tried to withdraw money from the bank.  What really was happening is that the CurrentStage (CS) would get stuck on one stage & not move on.  Fixed this bug, simply had three lines inside a begin and end statement that should have been outside of it.6/27/96	12:26am	-Alteration-Changed a little of the initilization code so that hermes will display the 'loading' text in color instead of that old drab black and white.  Hope this doesn't cause any conflicts or bugs. =)	-Bug Fix-Slycrel would occasionally cause a bus error when Hermes quit.  Fixed some Memory Management code (loading of different segments).  Should fix the bus error problem.	-Alteration-Turned off the "Check Login" box in the HRMS resource.  Got rid calling useless code that could potentially cause problems.6/24/96  7:05pm  -Bug Fix-Slycrel would attempt to create new weapons and armor files if none existed when the user attempted to buy one in the Armory.  When no armor file was present slycrel would attempt to create a weapons file which was wrong, it should have tried to create an armor file.  Corrected Problem, now creates an armor file like it should.6/24/96  6:51pm  -Bug Fix-Slycrel would display the weapons or armor list and prompt the user to buy one of the items.  If the user hit enter it would display several Error messages, Bug fixed.  -Alteration- Swapped commands for 'swapping weapnos' between weapon #1 and weapon #1.  It was 'X' I changed it to 'M' for move weapons; the 'X' was confusing as that is the command to quit Slycrel.  (it bugged me) *Don't forget to change ANSI menu!*Date Unknown	-Release-Released 'Slycrel dev v2.00'  Uploaded to Olympus BBS and the Twilight Zone BBS.Known Bugs & Work-Arounds for them: (е=important, ее=fix NOW, *=Solved, ?=not sure)	These are bugs that I'm aware of, and I'm only pulling them off of the top of my head so I'm most likely going to miss quite a few. е	There  is a duplicate player in the player list (viewable in the Arena), what's up w/ that?  Well... the problem arises when a user fights another character in the arena, after the user quits slycrel it seems to dissapear and go back to how it should. е	Infinite loop occures when a player tries to enter the inn when closed. е	When the sysop se